From: VLCDotNet CI <ci@vlcdotnet>
Subject: [PATCH] win32: include dxgicommon/DXGI headers before d3d11_1.h

The Windows x64 llvm-mingw toolchain fails to compile
modules/video_output/win32/direct3d11.c because d3d11_1.h references
DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_TYPE before dxgicommon.h has declared it, and the resulting
header parse failure cascades into missing IDXGIResource1 declarations too:

  unknown type name 'DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_TYPE'
  unknown type name 'IDXGIResource1'

Include dxgicommon.h explicitly and keep the DXGI headers before d3d11_1.h so
the DXGI declarations are available first.
---
 modules/video_output/win32/direct3d11.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/modules/video_output/win32/direct3d11.c b/modules/video_output/win32/direct3d11.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/modules/video_output/win32/direct3d11.c
+++ b/modules/video_output/win32/direct3d11.c
@@ -20,12 +20,13 @@
 
 #define COBJMACROS
 #include <initguid.h>
-#include <d3d11_1.h>
+#include <dxgicommon.h>
 #ifdef HAVE_DXGI1_6_H
 # include <dxgi1_6.h>
 #else
 # include <dxgi1_5.h>
 #endif
+#include <d3d11_1.h>
 #ifdef HAVE_D3D11_4_H
 #include <d3d11_4.h>
 #endif